uest, TransferResponse&gt;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> đóng vai trò là Tool (</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">bankTransferTool</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hàm này sẽ giả lập quá trình xử lý của Core Banking: Kiểm tra số dư tài khoản nguồn (mặc định giả lập một số dư cố định), nếu đủ tiền thực hiện trừ tiền và trả về trạng thái&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">SUCCESS</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> kèm&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">transactionId</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> ngẫu nhiên; nếu thiếu tiền, trả về&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">FAILED</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> kèm thông báo tương ứng.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cấu hình mô tả chi tiết thông qua các thuộc tính của&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-de